  ('m','Bene Israel lived on the','Konkan coast','Coromandel coast','Kashmir valley','Just south of Mumbai.'),
  ('t','Siddis are people of African origin in India.',True,'They have a distinctive drumming dance.'),
  ('m','The Lotus Temple in New Delhi belongs to','the Baha\'i community','Parsis','Jains','It is a famous Baha\'i temple.'),
  ('m','Armenians settled in India in places like','Surat, Kolkata and Chennai','Leh and Shimla only','Goa only','They built schools and churches.'),
